#!/bin/zsh
# xreview-app [xreview args…] — kept for sessions recorded with its path, until the TUI is retired
# (spec 2026-11-14, 5.7). xreview now picks the Herdr app front end itself, from the terminal it runs in.
# This runs outside Claude Code's sandbox with the caller's PATH, so PATH is pinned to folders the sandbox cannot write.
# XREVIEW_APP_XREVIEW replaces the xreview command; for the tests only.
PATH=/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin
exec "${XREVIEW_APP_XREVIEW:-$HOME/.local/bin/xreview}" "$@"
